{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# ⟨W_a^L|Ψ⟩ as an F-only SoV sum at L = 3 pairs (6 sites) — 2026-10-13\n\nAgent task: extend the L = 2 result of `Wa-sov-expansion-L4.wb` §10 to L = 3. Prefix `fd`, no memoisation, vectors only (no 4096×4096 matrix). Chain A F A F A F, site 1 most significant; Lax ℒ_s(u) = Σ e_ij ⊗ ((u−θ_s)δ_ij + hρ_s(E_ij)), ρ_A(E_ij) = e_ij, ρ_F(E_ij) = −e_ji; T = ℒ₁⋯ℒ₆, t₁^G(u) = Σ T_ij G_ji; M·ψ is the ket action, ψ·M (bra action) = Mᵀψ. Companion twist G_c(z), frame map t^{G_c}R = R t^Λ, R = V^{−T} (A) ⊗ V (F).\n\n**Evidence tags:** [exact] rational arithmetic; [hp] arbitrary-precision numerics (digits stated); [num] machine precision.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 0. Machinery: site-by-site propagation of the monodromy on vectors (ket action M.v, bra action v.M = Mᵀ.v)\n\nΦ_s[I][J] = (ℒ₁⋯ℒ_s)_{IJ} v; per site: A: Φ'_J[a] = (u−θ)Φ_J[a] + h Φ_a[J] (slice), F: Φ'_J[a] = (u−θ)Φ_J[a] − h δ_{aJ} Σ_K Φ_K[K]; the transposed (bra) versions swap the roles (A ↔ F structure with sign). t₁^G v = Σ_IJ G_JI Φ_N[I][J]. Tested against explicit 16×16 matrices on one pair before use.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fd machinery. No memoisation. Vectors are flat lists of length 4^nn, site 1 most significant.\n   fdStep: one site of the monodromy propagation for the aux row I fixed (Phi = list over J of flat vectors).\n   tr = False: ket action M.v ; tr = True: transposed site operators, i.e. the bra action v.M. *)\nfdStep[Phi_, s_, nn_, ty_, th_, u_, h_, tr_] := Module[{l = 4^(s - 1), r = 4^(nn - s), X, sl, trc, sg, out, zero},\n  X = Table[ArrayReshape[Phi[[J]], {l, 4, r}], {J, 4}];\n  sl = (ty === \"A\") =!= tr; sg = If[ty === \"A\", 1, -1]; zero = ConstantArray[0, {l, r}];\n  If[sl,\n   out = Table[(u - th) X[[J]] + sg h Transpose[Table[X[[a, All, J, All]], {a, 4}], {2, 1, 3}], {J, 4}],\n   trc = Sum[X[[K, All, K, All]], {K, 4}];\n   out = Table[(u - th) X[[J]] + sg h Transpose[Table[If[a == J, trc, zero], {a, 4}], {2, 1, 3}], {J, 4}]];\n  Map[Flatten, out]];\nfdApplyT1[G_, u_, types_, th_, h_, v_, tr_] := Module[{nn = Length[types], rows, zero = ConstantArray[0, Length[v]], res = ConstantArray[0, Length[v]], Phi},\n  rows = Select[Range[4], AnyTrue[G[[All, #]], # =!= 0 &] &];\n  Do[Phi = Table[If[K == I1, v, zero], {K, 4}];\n   Do[Phi = fdStep[Phi, s, nn, types[[s]], th[[s]], u, h, tr], {s, nn}];\n   res = res + Sum[G[[J, I1]] Phi[[J]], {J, 4}], {I1, rows}];\n  res];\n(* explicit matrices (test only, nn <= 4): Lax entries, T, t1^G *)\nfdSiteOp[s_, nn_, m_] := KroneckerProduct @@ ReplacePart[Table[IdentityMatrix[4], nn], s -> m];\nfdExplicitT1[G_, u_, types_, th_, h_] := Module[{nn = Length[types], d, E1, lax, T},\n  d = 4^nn; E1[i_, j_] := Normal[SparseArray[{{i, j} -> 1}, {4, 4}]];\n  lax[s_] := Table[(u - th[[s]]) KroneckerDelta[i, j] IdentityMatrix[d] + h fdSiteOp[s, nn, If[types[[s]] === \"A\", E1[i, j], -E1[j, i]]], {i, 4}, {j, 4}];\n  T = Fold[Function[{A, B}, Table[Sum[A[[i, k]] . B[[k, j]], {k, 4}], {i, 4}, {j, 4}]], lax[1], Table[lax[s], {s, 2, nn}]];\n  Sum[T[[i, j]] G[[j, i]], {i, 4}, {j, 4}]];\n{\"loaded\", MemoryInUse[]/10.^9}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"91\" data-out-n=\"516\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"24\" data-sub-end=\"24\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[516]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1x0ZXh0e2xvYWRlZH0sMi4zOTQ0NzM2ODhccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">loaded</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.394473688</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[516]= \\left\\{\\text{loaded},2.394473688\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0c6cd5b0-3c5c-4c3f-a3d7-447e2de316fe"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Building-block test: ONE pair (A F) and TWO pairs (A F A F), exact, generic G and theta *)\nfdTest1 = Module[{h = 1/2, G = {{1, 2, -1, 3}, {0, 5, 1, -2}, {2, 1, 0, 4}, {3, -1, 2, 7}}},\n  Map[Function[pr, Module[{ty = pr[[1]], th = pr[[2]], u = 3/7, M, v},\n     M = fdExplicitT1[G, u, ty, th, h];\n     SeedRandom[5]; v = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, 4^Length[ty]]/RandomInteger[{1, 4}, 4^Length[ty]];\n     {Length[ty], M . v === fdApplyT1[G, u, ty, th, h, v, False], v . M === fdApplyT1[G, u, ty, th, h, v, True]}]],\n   {{{\"A\", \"F\"}, {2/7, -3/5}}, {{\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}, {2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8}}}]];\nGrid[Prepend[fdTest1, {\"# sites\", \"ket action == explicit M.v\", \"bra action == explicit v.M\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"94\" data-out-n=\"522\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[522]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfGN8fVxobGluZVx0ZXh0e1wjIHNpdGVzfSAmIFx0ZXh0e2tldCBhY3Rpb24gPT0gZXhwbGljaXQgTS52fSAmIFx0ZXh0e2JyYSBhY3Rpb24gPT0gZXhwbGljaXQgdi5NfVxcXGhsaW5lMiAmIFxtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX0gJiBcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9XFxcaGxpbmU0ICYgXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfSAmIFxtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX1cXFxobGluZVxlbmR7YXJyYXl9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># sites</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ket action == explicit M.v</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bra action == explicit v.M</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
