       "data": "Out[528]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{G\\_c V == V Lambda} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{t\\^{}\\{G\\_c\\} R == R t\\^{}Lambda (1 pair, 2 pairs)} & \\begin{pmatrix}2 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\4 & \\mathrm{True}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
