      {
       "data": "Out[667]= No output at Out[667]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d40d3b75-9a05-4091-9886-b2108708e92e"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### (3) Q-form on eigenstates, generic point [hp]\n\nEigenvectors of t₁^Λ(1/3) in each sector: machine-precision `Eigensystem`, then refined by hp inverse iteration (50 digits). τ_s = eigenvalue of t₁^Λ(θ_s) read off by vector application. Test: ⟨W_a^3|Ψ⟩ (diag frame, a = 3/7) vs (a/κ₀)^n (λ₁u₄)^{−3} ⟨0|Ψ⟩ Σ_k c_k τ₂^{k₂}τ₄^{k₄}τ₆^{k₆}.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fdSectorMat[n_] := Module[{ks = Sort[Select[Keys[fdColsA], First[#] == n &], #1[[2]] < #2[[2]] &]}, Transpose[Join @@ (fdColsA /@ ks)]];\n(* fixed-precision (no significance tracking) inverse iteration *)\nfdRefine[M_, x0_, sig_, prec_] := Block[{$MinPrecision = prec, $MaxPrecision = prec}, Module[{d = Length[M], ls, x = SetPrecision[x0, prec]},\n  ls = LinearSolve[SetPrecision[M, prec] - SetPrecision[sig, prec] IdentityMatrix[d]];\n  Do[x = ls[x]; x = x/Norm[x], {3}]; x]];\nfdLamZ = Table[1/Product[If[m == j, 1, fdZ[[j]] - fdZ[[m]]], {m, 4}], {j, 4}];\nfdKap0 = -((fdZ[[1]] - fdZ[[2]]) (fdZ[[1]] - fdZ[[3]]))/((fdZ[[4]] - fdZ[[2]]) (fdZ[[4]] - fdZ[[3]]));\nfdU4 = (fdZ[[4]] - fdZ[[2]]) (fdZ[[4]] - fdZ[[3]]);\nfdBra0Lam = fdKron[{fdLamZ, {1, 1, 1, 1}, fdLamZ, {1, 1, 1, 1}, fdLamZ, {1, 1, 1, 1}}];\nfdWaBra[a_] := fdKron[{{1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}}];\nfdQcheck[n_, x_, idx_, a_] := Block[{$MinPrecision = 50, $MaxPrecision = 50}, Module[{psi = ConstantArray[0, 4096], p, taus, lhs, rhs, ov0, csum},\n  psi[[idx]] = x; p = idx[[First[Ordering[Abs[x], -1]]]];\n  taus = Table[(fdApplyT1[fdLam, fdTh6[[2 s]], fdTy6, fdTh6, fdH, psi, False])[[p]]/psi[[p]], {s, 3}];\n  lhs = fdWaBra[a] . psi; ov0 = fdBra0Lam . psi;\n  csum = Total[MapThread[#1 Times @@ (taus^#2) &, {fdSol, fdWordsK}]];\n  rhs = (a/fdKap0)^n (fdLamZ[[1]] fdU4)^-3 ov0 csum;\n  {n, N[Abs[lhs], 8], N[Abs[lhs - rhs]/Abs[lhs], 3], N[taus[[1]], 8]}]];\n{\"defined\", MemoryInUse[]/10.^9}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"120\" data-out-n=\"696\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"20\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[696]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[696]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[696]= No output at Out[696]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0cfa7b13-cd34-416f-b074-7a41561b81ea"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (3) sectors n = 0,1,2 : eigenstates refined to 50 digits; compare direct <W_a^3|Psi> with the Q-form *)\nfdGen012 = Flatten[Table[Module[{M = fdSectorMat[n], d, vals, vecs, picks},\n    d = Length[M]; {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[M]]; picks = Take[Range[d], Min[d, {1, 3, 3}[[n + 1]]]];\n    Table[Module[{x = fdRefine[M, vecs[[j]], vals[[j]], 50], res},\n      res = Block[{$MinPrecision = 50, $MaxPrecision = 50}, Module[{Mx = SetPrecision[M, 50] . x, q = First[Ordering[Abs[x], -1]]}, Norm[Mx - (Mx[[q]]/x[[q]]) x]]];\n      Append[fdQcheck[n, x, fdIdx[n], 3/7], N[res, 3]]], {j, picks}]], {n, 0, 2}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[fdGen012, {\"n\", \"|<W_a^3|Psi>|\", \"rel. dev. direct vs Q-form\", \"tau(th2)\", \"eigen-residual\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
