  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Fused transfer matrices t_2, t_3 on vectors (ket action), tests, then the L = 3 ABJM ε-chain\n\nPort of the `ue` fused construction (aux = ∧ᵏ C⁴, site blocks from the derivative of the compound determinant), with the site operators applied as sparse slice operations, number-agnostic (exact or hp). Tests: (a) k = 1 agrees with `fdApplyT1`; (b) L = 2 untwisted ABJM operator identity X̂₃X₁ = 24 h⁷ λ₁λ₃ P (pair translation); (c) L = 3: K₁ on the six data [1,0,1] HW states (3.656854, −7.656854, 14.658003 (x2), 1.842 (x2)).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fdDKall[k_] := Module[{S = Subsets[Range[4], {k}], eps},\n  Table[Coefficient[Det[(IdentityMatrix[4] + eps Normal[SparseArray[{{a, b} -> 1}, {4, 4}]])[[ii, jj]]], eps, 1], {a, 4}, {b, 4}, {ii, S}, {jj, S}]];\nfdBlk[k_, ty_] := Module[{dk = fdDKall[k], n = Binomial[4, k]},\n  Table[Module[{ent = {}}, Do[With[{c = dk[[a, b, K, J]]}, If[c =!= 0, AppendTo[ent, If[ty === \"A\", {a, b, c}, {b, a, -c}]]]], {a, 4}, {b, 4}]; ent], {K, n}, {J, n}]];\nfdBL = Association[Flatten[Table[{k, ty} -> fdBlk[k, ty], {k, 1, 3}, {ty, {\"A\", \"F\"}}], 1]];\nfdStepGen[Phi_, s_, nn_, ty_, th_, u_, h_, k_, tr_] := Module[{n = Binomial[4, k], l = 4^(s - 1), r = 4^(nn - s), tt, X, zero, bl},\n  bl = If[tr, Map[{#[[2]], #[[1]], #[[3]]} &, fdBL[{k, ty}], {3}], fdBL[{k, ty}]];\n  tt = If[ty === \"A\", th, th + (k - 1) h];\n  X = Table[ArrayReshape[Phi[[K]], {l, 4, r}], {K, n}]; zero = ConstantArray[0, {l, r}];\n  Table[Flatten[(u - tt) X[[J]] + h Sum[Transpose[Table[zero + Sum[e[[3]] X[[K, All, e[[2]], All]], {e, Select[bl[[K, J]], #[[1]] == a &]}], {a, 4}], {2, 1, 3}], {K, n}]], {J, n}]];\nfdCompound[k_, G_] := With[{S = Subsets[Range[4], {k}]}, Table[Det[G[[ii, jj]]], {ii, S}, {jj, S}]];\nfdGpref[k_, u_, types_, th_, h_, reg_] := Times @@ Flatten[Table[Table[With[{f = u - th[[s]] - j h}, If[reg && f == 0, 1, f]], {j, If[types[[s]] === \"A\", Range[1, k - 1], Range[0, k - 2]]}], {s, Length[types]}]];\n(* t_k^G(u) with prefactor; tr = False: ket action M.v ; tr = True: bra action v.M *)\nfdApplyTk[k_, G_, u_, types_, th_, h_, v_, reg_, tr_] := Module[{nn = Length[types], n = Binomial[4, k], W = fdCompound[k, G], zero = ConstantArray[0, Length[v]], res = ConstantArray[0, Length[v]], Phi},\n  Do[If[AnyTrue[W[[All, I1]], # =!= 0 &],\n    Phi = Table[If[K == I1, v, zero], {K, n}];\n    Do[Phi = fdStepGen[Phi, s, nn, types[[s]], th[[s]], u, h, k, tr], {s, nn}];\n    res = res + Sum[W[[J, I1]] Phi[[J]], {J, n}]], {I1, n}];\n  fdGpref[k, u, types, th, h, reg] res];\nfdLamC[k_, u_, thA_, thF_, p_, h_] := Times @@ Flatten[Table[If[n == p, {}, Table[With[{f = ff}, If[f == 0, 1, f]], {ff, Join[Table[u - thA[[n]] - j h, {j, 0, k - 1}], {u - thF[[n]] - k h}, Table[u - thF[[n]] - j h, {j, 0, k - 2}]]}]], {n, Length[thA]}]];\n(* tests on 2 pairs: (a) k = 1 vs fdApplyT1 (ket and bra), (b) untwisted ABJM identity X3^ X1 = 24 h^7 lam1 lam3 P, (c) ket/bra consistency of k = 2, 3 *)\nfdTestK = TimeConstrained[Module[{h = 1/2, ty = {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}, thF = {0, 0}, thA, th, u0 = 1/2, I4 = IdentityMatrix[4], v, w, X3X1v, lam, tup, Pv, th1, G1},\n  thA = thF + 2 h; th = {thA[[1]], thF[[1]], thA[[2]], thF[[2]]};\n  SeedRandom[11]; v = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, 256]; w = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, 256];\n  lam = {fdLamC[1, thF[[1]], thA, thF, 1, h], fdLamC[2, u0, thA, thF, 1, h], fdLamC[3, u0, thA, thF, 1, h]};\n  X3X1v = fdApplyTk[3, I4, u0, ty, th, h, fdApplyTk[1, I4, thF[[1]], ty, th, h, v, False, False], True, False];\n  tup = Tuples[Range[4], 4];\n  Pv = Table[v[[FromDigits[{tup[[q, 3]], tup[[q, 4]], tup[[q, 1]], tup[[q, 2]]} - 1, 4] + 1]], {q, 256}];\n  th1 = {2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8}; G1 = {{1, 2, -1, 3}, {0, 5, 1, -2}, {2, 1, 0, 4}, {3, -1, 2, 7}};\n  {fdApplyTk[1, G1, 3/7, ty, th1, h, v, False, False] === fdApplyT1[G1, 3/7, ty, th1, h, v, False],\n   fdApplyTk[1, G1, 3/7, ty, th1, h, v, False, True] === fdApplyT1[G1, 3/7, ty, th1, h, v, True],\n   X3X1v === 24 h^7 lam[[1]] lam[[3]] Pv,\n   Table[w . fdApplyTk[k, G1, 1/5, ty, th1, h, v, False, False] === v . fdApplyTk[k, G1, 1/5, ty, th1, h, w, False, True], {k, 2, 3}]}], 40, \"timed out\"];\nfdTestK",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"129\" data-out-n=\"739\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"24\" data-sub-start=\"33\" data-sub-end=\"33\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[739]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[739]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[739]= No output at Out[739]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "72abb8ce-0d34-4fc1-b54c-56943b0f0451"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* test (c): L = 3 untwisted ABJM chain, K1 on the six data [1,0,1] HW states from hw_L3.json (machine precision), eigenvalues by the bra action on a unit vector *)\nfdDat = Import[\"C:/Users/pryan/git-projects/abjm-c123/Paul/Mathematica/su4-alternating/checks/session-2026-10-13/epsexp/hw_L3.json\", \"RawJSON\"];\nfdTestK3 = Module[{h = 1/2, th = {1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0}, thA = {1, 1, 1}, thF = {0, 0, 0}, u0 = 1/2, I4 = IdentityMatrix[4], lam, c},\n  lam = {fdLamC[1, 0, thA, thF, 1, h], fdLamC[2, u0, thA, thF, 1, h], fdLamC[3, u0, thA, thF, 1, h]};\n  c = {1, -1/(h^2 lam[[1]]), -1/(2 h^4 lam[[2]]), -1/(6 h^5 lam[[3]]), 1/(24 h^7 lam[[1]] lam[[3]])};\n  Table[Module[{psi = fdDat[\"psiRe\"][[i]] + I fdDat[\"psiIm\"][[i]], p, e, t1, t2, t3, K1, Cd},\n    p = First[Ordering[Abs[psi], -1]]; e = fdUnit[p, 4096];\n    t1 = fdApplyTk[1, I4, 0, fdTy6, th, h, e, False, True] . psi/psi[[p]];\n    t2 = fdApplyTk[2, I4, u0, fdTy6, th, h, e, False, True] . psi/psi[[p]];\n    t3 = fdApplyTk[3, I4, u0, fdTy6, th, h, e, True, True] . psi/psi[[p]];\n    K1 = c . {1, t1, t2, t3, t3 t1}; Cd = fdDat[\"CRe\"][[i]][[5]] + I fdDat[\"CIm\"][[i]][[5]];\n    {i, fdDat[\"dyn\"][[i]], fdDat[\"w\"][[i]], Chop[N[K1, 7], 10^-6], N[Cd, 6]}], {i, 17, 22}]];\nGrid[Prepend[fdTestK3, {\"data state (1-based)\", \"Dynkin\", \"weight\", \"K1 (this port)\", \"C_data(M=1)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"137\" data-out-n=\"771\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"25\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[771]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[771]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[771]= No output at Out[771]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d2dd6736-695e-4285-80be-5bac4dd58422"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* eps-chain at L = 3: parameters exactly as Wa-sov-expansion-L4.wb cells 43-45 (L = 2) *)\nfdEpsPhi = {9/10, 7/20, 3/5, -11/10}; fdEpsTh0 = {0, 37/100, -52/100}; fdEpsC = 3/10;\nfdEpsSetup[eps_] := Module[{h = fdH, z = 1 + eps fdEpsPhi, thF = eps fdEpsTh0, thA, thE, u0, kap, a, y, s},\n  thA = thF + 2 h; thE = Riffle[thA, thF]; u0 = thF[[1]] + h; kap = 1 - fdEpsC eps; a = (fdEpsPhi[[1]] - fdEpsC)/(fdEpsPhi[[1]] - fdEpsPhi[[4]]);\n  y = (z[[2]] + z[[3]])/2; s = 1 - kap (z[[1]] + z[[4]]);\n  <|\"eps\" -> eps, \"z\" -> z, \"thF\" -> thF, \"thA\" -> thA, \"thE\" -> thE, \"u0\" -> u0, \"kap\" -> kap, \"a\" -> a, \"y\" -> y, \"s\" -> s, \"Nk\" -> (1 - kap z[[1]])^2,\n   \"l\" -> {fdLamC[1, thF[[1]], thA, thF, 1, h], fdLamC[2, u0, thA, thF, 1, h], fdLamC[3, u0, thA, thF, 1, h]},\n   \"lamz\" -> Table[1/Product[If[m == j, 1, z[[j]] - z[[m]]], {m, 4}], {j, 4}],\n   \"kap0\" -> -((z[[1]] - z[[2]]) (z[[1]] - z[[3]]))/((z[[4]] - z[[2]]) (z[[4]] - z[[3]])), \"u4\" -> (z[[4]] - z[[2]]) (z[[4]] - z[[3]])|>];\nfdEpsMats = <||>; fdEpsStates = <||>; fdEpsOut = <||>;\n(* data states 17..22 (1-based); 19,20 and 21,22 are degenerate (complex-conjugate parity partners): select eigenvectors by projection onto the span of each degenerate group *)\nfdEpsGroups = {{17}, {18}, {19, 20}, {21, 22}};\n(* stage A: exact sector matrix of t1^Lambda(3/11) in the (1,0,0,-1) sector *)\nfdEpsBuild[eps_] := Module[{S = fdEpsSetup[eps]}, fdEpsMats[eps] = Transpose[fdSecCols[fdIdx[2], 3/11, fdTy6, S[\"thE\"], fdH, DiagonalMatrix[S[\"z\"]], 1, 141]]; {eps, MemoryInUse[]/10.^9}];\n(* stage B: machine eigensystem, selection by projection on the data groups, hp inverse iteration *)\nfdEpsEig[eps_, prec_] := Module[{M = fdEpsMats[eps], vals, vecs, idx = fdIdx[2], picks},\n  {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[M]];\n  picks = Flatten[Table[Module[{ps = Table[(fdDat[\"psiRe\"][[i]] + I fdDat[\"psiIm\"][[i]])[[idx]], {i, grp}], Q, w, sel},\n     Q = Orthogonalize[ps]; w = Table[Norm[Conjugate[Q] . vecs[[q]]]/Norm[vecs[[q]]], {q, Length[vecs]}];\n     sel = Take[Ordering[w, -Length[grp]], -Length[grp]]; Table[{grp[[1]], q, w[[q]]}, {q, Reverse[sel]}]], {grp, fdEpsGroups}], 1];\n  fdEpsStates[eps] = Map[<|\"group\" -> #[[1]], \"ov\" -> #[[3]], \"val\" -> vals[[#[[2]]]], \"x\" -> fdRefine[M, vecs[[#[[2]]]], vals[[#[[2]]]], prec]|> &, picks];\n  Map[{#[[1]], N[#[[3]], 6], N[vals[[#[[2]]]], 8]} &, picks]];\n(* stage C: exact c_k at this eps, bras for tau's, assembly of C_direct = K <W_a^3|Psi>/N and C_Q *)\nfdEpsAssemble[eps_, prec_] := Block[{$MinPrecision = prec, $MaxPrecision = prec}, Module[{S = fdEpsSetup[eps], h = fdH, z, thE, Lam, idx = fdIdx[2], sts = fdEpsStates[eps], run, sol, p, e, bras, psis, br0, brW, rows, u0},\n  z = S[\"z\"]; thE = S[\"thE\"]; Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z]; u0 = S[\"u0\"];\n  run = fdFonlyRun[3, thE, z, h, 2]; sol = run[\"sol\"]; run = Null;\n  psis = Table[Module[{ps = ConstantArray[0, 4096]}, ps[[idx]] = st[\"x\"]; ps], {st, sts}];\n  p = First[Ordering[Table[Min[Table[Abs[ps[[idx[[q]]]]], {ps, psis}]], {q, Length[idx]}], -1]]; p = idx[[p]]; e = fdUnit[p, 4096];\n  bras = {fdApplyT1[Lam, thE[[2]], fdTy6, thE, h, e, True], fdApplyT1[Lam, thE[[4]], fdTy6, thE, h, e, True], fdApplyT1[Lam, thE[[6]], fdTy6, thE, h, e, True],\n    fdApplyTk[2, Lam, u0, fdTy6, thE, h, e, False, True], fdApplyTk[3, Lam, u0, fdTy6, thE, h, e, True, True]};\n  br0 = fdKron[{S[\"lamz\"], {1, 1, 1, 1}, S[\"lamz\"], {1, 1, 1, 1}, S[\"lamz\"], {1, 1, 1, 1}}]; brW = fdWaBra[S[\"a\"]];\n  rows = Table[Module[{ps = psis[[j]], tau, X1, X2, X3, K, w, ov0, csum, cd, cq, l = S[\"l\"], kap = S[\"kap\"], y = S[\"y\"], ss = S[\"s\"]},\n    tau = (bras . ps)/ps[[p]]; X1 = tau[[1]]; X2 = tau[[4]]; X3 = tau[[5]];\n    K = ss^2 + kap ss (X1/(h^2 l[[1]]) + X2/(2 h^4 y l[[2]]) + X3/(6 h^5 y^2 l[[3]])) + kap^2 X3 X1/(24 h^7 y^2 l[[1]] l[[3]]);\n    w = brW . ps; ov0 = br0 . ps; csum = Total[MapThread[#1 Times @@ (tau[[1 ;; 3]]^#2) &, {sol, fdWordsK}]];\n    cd = K w/S[\"Nk\"]; cq = K (S[\"a\"]/S[\"kap0\"])^2 (S[\"lamz\"][[1]] S[\"u4\"])^-3 ov0 csum/S[\"Nk\"];\n    <|\"group\" -> sts[[j]][\"group\"], \"Cd\" -> cd, \"Cq\" -> cq, \"K\" -> K, \"w\" -> w, \"ov0\" -> ov0, \"tau\" -> tau|>], {j, Length[psis]}];\n  fdEpsOut[eps] = rows; Map[{#[\"group\"], N[Abs[#[\"Cd\"]], 8], N[Abs[#[\"Cq\"] - #[\"Cd\"]]/Abs[#[\"Cd\"]], 3]} &, rows]]];\n{\"defined\", MemoryInUse[]/10.^9}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"138\" data-out-n=\"779\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"26\" data-sub-start=\"38\" data-sub-end=\"38\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[779]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[779]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
