   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Structure of the coefficients: the F-chain Cherednik model\n\nLevel grading: F-site vector e₄, e₃, e₂ = level 0, 1, 2; the twist acts as the raising operator N (e₄G = e₃, e₃G = e₂). On bras with no e₁ content at the F sites the A–F exchange terms are scalars, and t₁(θ_s) acts as t₁(θ_s) = κ_s Ŷ_s with\n\n  Ŷ_s = R_{s,s+1}⋯R_{s,L} N_s R_{s,1}⋯R_{s,s−1},  R_{sf} = 1 − (h/(θ_s−θ_f)) P_{sf}  (row-vector action, product in this order),\n\ncommuting Cherednik-type operators on (C³)^{⊗L}. Target: ⊗_s f(N_s) applied to the vacuum, f(x) = p − s x + x² (p = z₂z₃, s = z₂+z₃). Test of the model against the 27 exact words of cell 9, then the exact coefficients in the Ŷ monomials.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* model: Cherednik operators on levels {0,1,2}^L, row-vector action; th = F-site thetas (F1..FL) *)\nfdModelSetup[L_, th_, h_] := Module[{basis = Tuples[{0, 1, 2}, L], n, idx, swap, raise, pm, nm, rm, Y},\n  n = Length[basis]; idx = AssociationThread[basis -> Range[n]];\n  swap[t_, i_, j_] := ReplacePart[t, {i -> t[[j]], j -> t[[i]]}];\n  raise[t_, s_] := ReplacePart[t, s -> t[[s]] + 1];\n  pm[i_, j_] := SparseArray[Table[{q, idx[swap[basis[[q]], i, j]]} -> 1, {q, n}], {n, n}];\n  nm[s_] := SparseArray[Flatten[Table[If[basis[[q, s]] < 2, {{q, idx[raise[basis[[q]], s]]} -> 1}, {}], {q, n}]], {n, n}];\n  rm[s_, f_] := IdentityMatrix[n, SparseArray] - (h/(th[[s]] - th[[f]])) pm[s, f];\n  Y = Table[Normal[Dot @@ Join[Table[rm[s, f], {f, s + 1, L}], {nm[s]}, Table[rm[s, f], {f, 1, s - 1}]]], {s, L}];\n  <|\"basis\" -> basis, \"idx\" -> idx, \"Y\" -> Y, \"n\" -> n, \"L\" -> L|>];\n(* words <vac| Y^k *)\nfdModelWords[mod_] := Module[{L = mod[\"L\"], vac = UnitVector[mod[\"n\"], 1], ks = Tuples[{0, 1, 2}, mod[\"L\"]]},\n  <|\"ks\" -> ks, \"vecs\" -> Table[Fold[Function[{v, sk}, Nest[#1 . mod[\"Y\"][[sk[[1]]]] &, v, sk[[2]]]], vac, Transpose[{Range[L], k}]], {k, ks}]|>];\n(* check at L = 3 generic F thetas vs the exact words: <0|t(theta_s) = kappa_s <vac|Y_s ; compare all 27 words *)\nfdModelCheck = Module[{L = 3, thF = fdTh6[[{2, 4, 6}]], mod, wd, full, ks, kap, devs},\n  mod = fdModelSetup[L, thF, fdH]; wd = fdModelWords[mod]; ks = wd[\"ks\"];\n  full[t_] := FromDigits[{1, 4 - t[[1]], 1, 4 - t[[2]], 1, 4 - t[[3]]} - 1, 4] + 1;\n  kap = Table[Module[{k1 = UnitVector[3, s], vm, vn, q}, vm = wd[\"vecs\"][[First[Flatten[Position[ks, k1]]]]]; vn = fdWords[k1];\n     q = First[Flatten[Position[vm, Except[0], {1}, Heads -> False]]]; vn[[full[mod[\"basis\"][[q]]]]]/vm[[q]]], {s, 3}];\n  devs = Table[Module[{vm = wd[\"vecs\"][[i]], vn = fdWords[ks[[i]]]}, Max[Abs[Table[vn[[full[mod[\"basis\"][[q]]]]] - (Times @@ (kap^ks[[i]])) vm[[q]], {q, mod[\"n\"]}]]]], {i, Length[ks]}];\n  <|\"kappa\" -> kap, \"max word deviation\" -> Max[devs], \"kappa formula\" -> Table[fdKappaS[2 s, fdTh6, fdH], {s, 3}]|>];\nGrid[{{\"kappa_s from the exact words\", fdModelCheck[\"kappa\"]}, {\"kappa_s from the closed formula\", fdModelCheck[\"kappa formula\"]}, {\"max deviation |exact word - kappa^k model word| over all 27 words x 27 components\", fdModelCheck[\"max word deviation\"]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"134\" data-out-n=\"761\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"28\" data-sub-start=\"21\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[761]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[761]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[761]= No output at Out[761]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f91dfd2e-bf48-4dfb-9e3d-0c44ec8e2e73"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Closed form (conjecture found in the model, python cross-checks `checks/session-2026-10-13/fonly/`), tested here on the full chain\n\nAll z-dependence is in the two roots: ⟨(e₁⊗ũ)^{⊗L}| = ⟨0| B_{z₂}(Ŷ) B_{z₃}(Ŷ), with the **single-root global F-rotation operator**\n\n  B_z(Ŷ) = Σ_{S ⊆ {F sites}} (−z)^{L−|S|} g_S ∏_{s∈S} Ŷ_s,  g_S = ∏_{s<t ∈ S} ν_st²/(ν_st² − h²),  ν_st = θ_s − θ_t,\n\nand t₁(θ_s) = κ_s Ŷ_s on the vacuum module, κ_s = h ∏_{A sites a} (±(θ_a − θ_s)) ∏_{F sites f≠s} (±(θ_f − θ_s)) with the sign + when the other site is to the left (θ_a − θ_s, θ_f − θ_s) and the opposite sign (θ_s − θ_a) when it is to the right (read off at L = 2). Test: c_k = [coefficient of Ŷ^k in B_{z₂}B_{z₃}]/∏κ_s^{k_s} against the exact solution `fdSol` of cell 10.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* closed form vs exact fdSol on the full chain, L = 3 generic point *)\nfdKappaS[q_, th_, h_] := h Times @@ Table[If[Mod[a, 2] == 1, If[a < q, th[[a]] - th[[q]], th[[q]] - th[[a]]], 1], {a, Length[th]}] Times @@ Table[If[Mod[a, 2] == 0 && a != q, If[a < q, th[[a]] - th[[q]], th[[q]] - th[[a]]], 1], {a, Length[th]}];\nfdClosedCk[th6_, z_, h_] := Module[{L = 3, thF = th6[[{2, 4, 6}]], y = {fdy1, fdy2, fdy3}, kap, g, B, F, z2 = z[[2]], z3 = z[[3]], cr},\n  kap = Table[fdKappaS[2 s, th6, h], {s, L}];\n  g[i_, j_] := (thF[[i]] - thF[[j]])^2/((thF[[i]] - thF[[j]])^2 - h^2);\n  B[zz_] := Sum[(-zz)^(L - Length[S]) Times @@ (g @@@ Subsets[S, {2}]) Times @@ y[[S]], {S, Subsets[Range[L]]}];\n  F = Expand[B[z2] B[z3]]; cr = Association[CoefficientRules[F, y]];\n  Table[Lookup[cr, {k}, 0][[1]]/Times @@ (kap^k), {k, fdWordsK}]];\nfdClosedSol = fdClosedCk[fdTh6, fdZ, fdH];\nGrid[{{\"closed form c_k == exact solution fdSol (all 27 k, exact rationals)\", fdClosedSol === fdSol}, {\"kappa_s\", Table[fdKappaS[2 s, fdTh6, fdH], {s, 3}]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"136\" data-out-n=\"768\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"30\" data-sub-start=\"9\" data-sub-end=\"9\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[768]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><pre class=\"vscode-wolfram-text-output\">No output at Out[768]</pre></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
