  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### (4) Even bridge M = 1 at L = 3 on the ABJM ε-chain (sector (1,0,0,−1), 141 states)\n\nStage A builds the exact 141×141 matrix of t₁^Λ(3/11) (vector propagation of unit vectors); stage B picks the eigenvectors that tend to the six data [1,0,1] HW states (by projection onto each degenerate data group; 19/20 and 21/22 are degenerate conjugate pairs) and refines them to 70 digits; stage C builds the exact c_k at this ε (27 words, exact solve), the bras for τ₁(θ_F1,2,3), X₂, X₃, and assembles C_direct = K·⟨W_a^3|Ψ⟩/(1−κ z₁)² and C_Q = K (a/κ₀)²(λ₁u₄)⁻³ ⟨0|Ψ⟩ Σc_kτ^k/(1−κ z₁)² (Ψ unit norm).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fdEpsNow = 1/800; fdEpsBuild[fdEpsNow]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
