  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* closed form vs exact solve at two further points: (i) other h, theta, z ; (ii) ABJM eps-chain point eps = 1/100 *)\nfdClosedCheck2 = Module[{pts, out},\n  pts = {{2/3, {3/11, -5/7, 9/13, -13/9, 4/9, -2/5}, {7/3, 3/2, -2/5, 5/6}}, With[{S = fdEpsSetup[1/100]}, {fdH, S[\"thE\"], S[\"z\"]}]};\n  Table[Module[{h = pt[[1]], th = pt[[2]], z = pt[[3]], run, cl}, run = fdFonlyRun[3, th, z, h, 2]; cl = fdClosedCk[th, z, h]; {run[\"rank words\"], run[\"rank with target\"], cl === run[\"sol\"]}], {pt, pts}]];\nGrid[Prepend[fdClosedCheck2, {\"rank(words)\", \"rank(words+target)\", \"closed form == exact c_k\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
